    {
      "id": "brief5",
      "x": 4620,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "ROUND 5 — instrument, not game. Same square tiling bones; no chamfers, brackets, glows or scanline. Run numbers at text size. Diamonds stay in the graph.\n\nType: IBM Plex Sans + JetBrains Mono — the typography those palettes grew up with.\n\nEverforest: warm, mossy, low-contrast greens; red only where you are needed. Nord: cooler, blue-grey, frost accents, aurora orange for attention."
    },
    {
      "id": "tui5",
      "x": 4620,
      "y": 2200,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "TUI polished: one border weight (heavy = focused), section labels in caps, gauges with a single glyph, notes right-aligned, palettes matched to the GUI so both clients read as one product."
    }
  ],
